<component>
    <div v-flex="" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>Table 表格组件</h2>

        <Card title="组件说明">
            <p>Table 是 WPF DataGrid 风格的声明式表格组件，支持数据绑定式列定义和声明式 Column 子标签，提供列头模板、列数据模板、合并列等高级功能。</p>
            <p>核心特性：columns/rows 数据绑定；Column 声明式子标签；template slot 插槽模板（header/cell/footer）；TableDelegate trait 模板委托；bordered/borderless/stripe 样式控制；合并列（col_span/row_span）。</p>
            <p>支持大小写两种标签形式：Table/table、Column/column。</p>
        </Card>

        <Card title="示例代码">
            <div class="code-block">{code_sample}</div>
        </Card>

        <Card title="演示效果">
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>1. 数据绑定式（API 文档表格）</h3>
                <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>2. 声明式 Column 定义</h3>
                <Table rows={user_rows} bordered="">
                    <Column key="name" title="姓名" width="120" />
                    <Column key="age" title="年龄" align="center" />
                    <Column key="email" title="邮箱" />
                </Table>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>3. 小写标签形式</h3>
                <table rows={user_rows} bordered="" stripe="">
                    <column key="name" title="姓名" />
                    <column key="age" title="年龄" align="center" />
                    <column key="email" title="邮箱" />
                </table>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>4. 插槽模板（自定义列头和底部）</h3>
                <Table rows={user_rows} bordered="">
                    <Column key="name" title="姓名" />
                    <Column key="age" title="年龄" />
                    <Column key="email" title="邮箱" />
                    <template slot="header">
                        <div h-flex="" style="color: blue; font-weight: bold; width: 100%;">
                            <span style="flex: 1;">姓名</span>
                            <span style="flex: 1; text-align: center;">年龄</span>
                            <span style="flex: 1;">邮箱</span>
                        </div>
                    </template>
                    <template slot="footer">
                        <span style="color: gray;">共 {user_rows.len()} 条记录</span>
                    </template>
                </Table>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>5. 单元格模板（Scoped Slot 参数访问）</h3>
                <p>通过 <code>&lt;template slot="cell" field="name"&gt;</code> 自定义 name 列渲染，模板内可直接引用闭包参数 <code>row_idx</code>。</p>
                <Table rows={user_rows} bordered="">
                    <Column key="name" title="姓名" width="160" />
                    <Column key="age" title="年龄" align="center" />
                    <Column key="email" title="邮箱" />
                    <template slot="cell" field="name">
                        <span style="color: blue; font-weight: bold;">第 {row_idx} 行</span>
                    </template>
                </Table>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>6. 合并列</h3>
                <Table rows={merged_rows} bordered="">
                    <Column key="category" title="分类" width="120" />
                    <Column key="name" title="名称" />
                    <Column key="value" title="值" align="center" />
                </Table>
            </div>
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
